             40      return softmax(q @ k.T / d_k ** 0.5) @ v
          </untrusted>
          
          <untrusted source="faq">
          [faq-1] Q: Why scale?
          A: To keep variance near one.
          </untrusted>
          
          Return the JSON object only.
        ''',
        'role': 'user',
      }),
